   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2019-09-09",
   "text": "Market Access for Generic Insulin Competition or the MAGIC Act \n This bill provides a pathway for the Food and Drug Administration to approve chemically synthesized insulin or an analogue of chemically synthesized insulin as a generic drug under the abbreviated new drug application process."
